# PD1936 device fragment, applied after soc:configs/sm8150.config.
#
# sm8150.config turns CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_ADRENO on, which makes the XNU link step
# require an Adreno archive ($ADRENO_ARCHIVE) that only the nabu-only
# `NabuAdreno` component provides. No SM8150 GPU component is selected for this
# board yet, so the link stops with "test -f $ADRENO_ARCHIVE failed".
#
# Disable the GPU here to get a linkable kernel first; re-enable (and add the
# Adreno component) once the boot chain reaches DarwinBoot with a payload.
# CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_ADRENO is not set
